  "len": 23,
  "en": "",
  "status": "todo",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 7490,
  "text_len": 20
 },
 {
  "id": "sce114:01D5D",
  "jp": "フェイン「“えんか”？　なんだそれは？」",
  "off": 7517,
  "len": 27,
  "en": "",
  "status": "todo",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 7519,
  "text_len": 24
 },
 {
  "id": "sce114:01D7B",
  "jp": "ヤマト「う～ん、たとえるニャら“日本人の{nl}　心の唄”かニャ？」",
  "off": 7547,
  "len": 43,
  "en": "",
  "status": "todo",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 7549,
  "text_len": 40
 },
 {
  "id": "sce114:01DA9",
  "jp": "フェイン「心？　それはつまり魂に直接響くような歌{nl}　ということか？」",
  "off": 7593,
  "len": 45,
  "en": "",
  "status": "todo",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 7595,
  "text_len": 42
 },
 {
  "id": "sce114:01DD9",
  "jp": "ヤマト「ま、まぁ、そんニャ感じ」",
